{"schemaVersion":1,"id":358,"sections":[{"id":"817001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20591],"start":0,"count":28},{"id":"817001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20592],"start":28,"count":15}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:1","scriptId":20591,"text":"由于遭到不明飞行战车兽袭击，始祖鸟小队迫降在了一处丛林中。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1115,"speaker":"利季娅·达诺娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:2","scriptId":20591,"text":"“疼疼疼……刚才那些是什么东西啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:3","scriptId":20591,"text":"利季娅被倒挂在了一颗大树上，她正在努力的用生存小刀切割缠绕在自己腿上的藤蔓。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1118,"speaker":"妮莉·斯托克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:4","scriptId":20591,"text":"“好像是一种虫子，有点像蝗虫？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1118,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:5","scriptId":20591,"text":"妮莉的飞行舞装发出了“咔咔”的响声，可能是在迫降的时候受到了撞击。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1118,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:6","scriptId":20591,"text":"她也在努力帮忙割断利季娅腿上的藤蔓。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1118,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1120,"speaker":"黛兰·沃茨","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:7","scriptId":20591,"text":"“航空舞装已经检查好了，引擎里的连杆好像断了两根……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1120,"right":1118,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1126,"speaker":"阿比盖尔·麦克莱恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:8","scriptId":20591,"text":"“我的舞装倒是没有问题，不过因为是老款，本身零件就不太靠谱……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1120,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:9","scriptId":20591,"text":"“砰！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1120,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:10","scriptId":20591,"text":"利季娅一头栽进了一堆灌木丛里……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1120,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1115,"speaker":"利季娅·达诺娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:11","scriptId":20591,"text":"“真是够了……我这边机翼废了半个，多半不能再飞行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:12","scriptId":20591,"text":"确认四人都平安无事之后，始祖鸟小队准备重新启程。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:13","scriptId":20591,"text":"完成攻击任务在返航的途中受到了不明战车兽的袭击才导致了现在这个窘境。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1126,"speaker":"阿比盖尔·麦克莱恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:14","scriptId":20591,"text":"“轻敌了，没想到那种像蝗虫一样的战车兽竟然那么厉害。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1118,"speaker":"妮莉·斯托克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:15","scriptId":20591,"text":"“是啊，无论是俯冲还是盘旋速度，都比我们这边快不少啊……要怎么才能和那么灵活的东西战斗啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1118,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1120,"speaker":"黛兰·沃茨","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:16","scriptId":20591,"text":"“如果是少量的话或许还有办法，但是十多架就完全没还手之力了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1118,"right":1120,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1115,"speaker":"利季娅·达诺娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:17","scriptId":20591,"text":"“这些该死的战车兽竟然偷袭我们。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1120,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1126,"speaker":"阿比盖尔·麦克莱恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:18","scriptId":20591,"text":"“很奇怪啊，这里的战车兽我们应该已经清理过了，为什么还会冒出来呢……？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1115,"speaker":"利季娅·达诺娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:19","scriptId":20591,"text":"“虫子总会从你想象不到的地方跑出来，战车兽也一样。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1120,"speaker":"黛兰·沃茨","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:20","scriptId":20591,"text":"“你那机翼已经不能飞了，只能用绳索把你拖回基地了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1120,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1115,"speaker":"利季娅·达诺娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:21","scriptId":20591,"text":"“是的……麻烦你了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1120,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1120,"speaker":"黛兰·沃茨","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:22","scriptId":20591,"text":"“不要再遇到那种飞虫战车兽就好了，我可没自信拖着你的情况下作战。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1120,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1115,"speaker":"利季娅·达诺娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:23","scriptId":20591,"text":"“如果遇到敌人请先把我抛下吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1120,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1120,"speaker":"黛兰·沃茨","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:24","scriptId":20591,"text":"“怎么可能把你抛下，我们保持低空飞行就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1120,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1126,"speaker":"阿比盖尔·麦克莱恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:25","scriptId":20591,"text":"“但低空的话，遇到地面的战车兽也不太好办呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1118,"speaker":"妮莉·斯托克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:26","scriptId":20591,"text":"“求救信号已经发出了，要不等长官来找我们也是一种办法。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1118,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1126,"speaker":"阿比盖尔·麦克莱恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:27","scriptId":20591,"text":"“不过我们都没带什么干粮，等不了很久吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1118,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"817001-PROLOGUE:20591:28","scriptId":20591,"text":"经过一番讨论始祖鸟小队决定先前往最近的公路，因为她们目前所在的丛林很难施救。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1118,"right":1126,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:1","scriptId":20592,"text":"结果始祖鸟小队在前往公路的途中还是遇到了不明的飞虫战车兽……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1118,"right":1126,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:2","scriptId":20592,"text":"不过这次她们很幸运，飞虫战车兽好像正在和另外的战车兽交战中，并没有空来找始祖鸟小队的麻烦。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1118,"right":1126,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1126,"speaker":"阿比盖尔·麦克莱恩","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:3","scriptId":20592,"text":"“呼……我们运气不错，那些虫子好像没空管我们的样子。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1126,"right":1126,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1120,"speaker":"黛兰·沃茨","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:4","scriptId":20592,"text":"“是啊，它们好像正在和一堆独角仙在战斗，战车兽之间也有会打架的吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1126,"right":1120,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1126,"speaker":"阿比盖尔·麦克莱恩","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:5","scriptId":20592,"text":"“或许是争夺地盘之类的？我们现在也管不了那么多，全速前进吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1126,"right":1120,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1118,"speaker":"妮莉·斯托克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:6","scriptId":20592,"text":"“我已经看到公路了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1126,"right":1118,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1115,"speaker":"利季娅·达诺娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:7","scriptId":20592,"text":"“哎，要不是动不了，我还想狠狠地给那些虫子点颜色看看。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1118,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1120,"speaker":"黛兰·沃茨","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:8","scriptId":20592,"text":"“你还是别逞能了，敌人单兵的能力很强，把它当做一般的虫子可是要吃大亏的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1120,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1115,"speaker":"利季娅·达诺娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:9","scriptId":20592,"text":"“呜呜……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1120,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:10","scriptId":20592,"text":"利季娅只能咽下这口恶气，接着她好像看到了什么。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1120,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1115,"speaker":"利季娅·达诺娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:11","scriptId":20592,"text":"“黛兰，你看那里！那个车队，好像是长官他们。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1120,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1120,"speaker":"黛兰·沃茨","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:12","scriptId":20592,"text":"“哪里哪里？啊！看到了，没想到动作那么快，已经到那里了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1115,"right":1120,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1126,"speaker":"阿比盖尔·麦克莱恩","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:13","scriptId":20592,"text":"“不得不说，这个指挥官的应变能力还挺强的，接应速度很快啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1126,"right":1120,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1118,"speaker":"妮莉·斯托克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:14","scriptId":20592,"text":"“这下总觉得心里踏实了不少，终于可以安心回基地了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1126,"right":1118,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1126,"speaker":"阿比盖尔·麦克莱恩","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"817001-EPILOGUE:20592:15","scriptId":20592,"text":"“嗯，加快速度吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1126,"right":1118,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
